I say goodbye to my family.
We send kisses.
I close my computer.
It is a good evening.
I am not sad now.
I look in my bag.
I take a picture from my bag.
It is a picture of my family.
Here is my mother and my father.
Here is my brother and my sister.
And here is my dog.
I go out into my kitchen.
Here stands my fridge.
I take a magnet.
I put the picture on my fridge.
Now my family sits on my fridge.
I look at my picture.
I smile.
I drink my tea.
It is warm and good.
